{{!
    @template local_vektradiscuss/button

    The student entry point on the results page: status sentence and button (REQ-068).

    A disabled button stays focusable (aria-disabled, not disabled) and exposes its reason through
    aria-describedby. State 1 (not enabled) renders nothing, or only the student's transcripts when there are
    some from earlier sessions.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * visible - whether anything is rendered
    * showstatus - whether the status sentence and the button are rendered (not in state 1)
    * uniqid - unique id prefix
    * state - render state code
    * statenumber - REQ-068 state number
    * heading - section heading
    * message - status sentence
    * enabled - whether the button acts
    * canstart - the button opens the pre-session screen
    * canresume - the button resumes the open session
    * buttonlabel - button text
    * suggestcopy - show the "download a copy" suggestion (state 6)
    * hastranscripts, transcriptsheading, transcripts - the student's transcripts (see transcript_links)

    The status part (data-region local_vektradiscuss-status) is re-rendered on its own when the discussion
    closes, so the open iframe, with its closing screen, stays in place.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "visible": true,
        "showstatus": true,
        "uniqid": "local-vektradiscuss-12",
        "state": "eligible",
        "statenumber": 4,
        "heading": "Assessment discussion",
        "message": "You can discuss this assessment with the assistant.",
        "enabled": true,
        "canstart": true,
        "canresume": false,
        "buttonlabel": "Discuss this assessment",
        "suggestcopy": false,
        "hastranscripts": false,
        "transcriptsheading": "Your transcripts",
        "transcripts": []
    }
}}
{{#visible}}
<section class="local-vektradiscuss-panel card my-3" aria-labelledby="{{uniqid}}-heading" data-state="{{state}}" data-statenumber="{{statenumber}}">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="h5 card-title" id="{{uniqid}}-heading">{{heading}}</h3>
        <div data-region="local_vektradiscuss-status">
            {{#showstatus}}
            <p class="mb-2" id="{{uniqid}}-message">{{message}}</p>
            {{#suggestcopy}}
                <p class="mb-2">{{#str}}state_closed_copy, local_vektradiscuss{{/str}}</p>
            {{/suggestcopy}}
            {{#canstart}}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="local_vektradiscuss-start" aria-describedby="{{uniqid}}-message">{{buttonlabel}}</button>
            {{/canstart}}
            {{#canresume}}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="local_vektradiscuss-resume" aria-describedby="{{uniqid}}-message">{{buttonlabel}}</button>
            {{/canresume}}
            {{^enabled}}
                {{^suggestcopy}}
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="{{uniqid}}-message">{{buttonlabel}}</button>
                {{/suggestcopy}}
            {{/enabled}}
            {{/showstatus}}
            {{#hastranscripts}}
                {{> local_vektradiscuss/transcript_links }}
            {{/hastranscripts}}
        </div>
        <div class="local-vektradiscuss-frame mt-3" data-region="local_vektradiscuss-frame"></div>
    </div>
</section>
{{/visible}}
